+- **Required regression:** missing declaration blocks owner progression and the mock checkout; accepted declaration survives Back and reload; pre-R-011 drafts do not acquire acceptance; the job title no longer exists or affects registration; Me / Someone else keeps billing ownership; keyboard, mobile and both themes usable; REPAIR_001 regressions still pass.
+- **Production note:** the eventual production ownership model (verification, delegated authority, transfer) is separate backend work and is not decided here.
